      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The code stays within the PDF domain and does not appear to access unrelated resources or perform hidden non-PDF behavior. However, the declared description substantially overstates the implemented capabilities. The actual primary functionality is PDF form inspection/filling and supporting coordinate/image utilities, not a comprehensive PDF toolkit for all listed PDF operations. Therefore the description does not accurately represent the code\u2019s behavior.",
      "remediation": "Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.",
