        "end_line": 3
      },
      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The trigger says to use the skill whenever a user mentions a .pdf file, even if they are not requesting PDF processing. In a PDF context this is somewhat risky because unnecessary activation can expose the agent to untrusted PDF parsing and file access paths, especially when combined with the broad file-read/write examples.",
      "remediation": "Narrow the trigger to explicit PDF-processing requests, such as extracting, creating, modifying, OCRing, or inspecting a PDF. Add guidance to avoid opening or processing a PDF merely because it is mentioned, and to ask for confirmation before accessing files.",
      "code_snippet": null,
      "intent": null,
      "tags": []
    },
